  "nature": {
    "en": "Regional intergovernmental economic forum of 'member economies'; decisions are non-binding and made by consensus",
    "zh": "區域性政府間經濟論壇，成員稱為「會員經濟體」；以共識決，決議不具法律拘束力"
  },
  "purpose": {
    "en": "Promotes free and open trade and investment, regional economic integration and sustainable growth around the Pacific Rim.",
    "zh": "推動環太平洋地區的貿易與投資自由化、區域經濟整合及永續成長。"
  },
